<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">一红一蓝的对杯 还有你借我的那件T恤</text><text for="L2">曾属于两人的房间 如今只剩我形单影只</text><text for="L3">你钟爱的那缕香水气息</text><text for="L4">又在曾经碰面的车站悄然泛起<span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(余香浮起)</span></text><text for="L5">说什么一切都能轻易忘却</text><text for="L6">别说得那么云淡风轻</text><text for="L7">毕竟连熬过今天<span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(只因)</span></text><text for="L8">都已是难以承受的煎熬</text><text for="L9">那是我的初恋 我曾爱得那样深沉</text><text for="L10">哪怕只是被你消遣 也甘愿沉沦</text><text for="L11">可心底深处 还是傻傻地深信着</text><text for="L12">你是真心爱着我的</text><text for="L13">你到底在哪里</text><text for="L14">快来抱紧我啊</text><text for="L15">真的好寂寞</text><text for="L16">任凭别人怎么笑我犯傻</text><text for="L17">我依然无法恨你 这刻骨铭心的初次心碎</text><text for="L18">游乐园 水族馆 绚烂烟火与冬日灯海</text><text for="L19">无论去往何方 只要有你便好</text><text for="L20">在聊天里闹别扭 赌气连发着表情包</text><text for="L21">如今闪闪发光的 竟只剩回忆了啊<span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" ttm:role="x-bg">(徒留回忆)</span></text><text for="L22">说什么往事随风都能抹去</text><text for="L23">请别说得那么轻巧</text><text for="L24">明明就连捱过今天</text><text for="L25">都让人痛彻心扉</text><text for="L26">那是第一场倾心的爱恋</text><text for="L27">我曾坚信你我也怀着同样的心意</text><text for="L28">我绝不想承认</text><text for="L29">原来这世间根本没有所谓永远</text><text for="L30">你在哪里呢</text><text for="L31">拥抱我好不好</text><text for="L32">我好孤单</text><text for="L33">就算旁人再怎么嘲讽我的执迷</text><text for="L34">我依旧狠不下心恨你 这痛彻的初次心碎</text><text for="L35">痛彻心扉 撕心裂肺</text><text for="L36">迎来了人生中第一场心碎</text><text for="L37">心如刀割 阵阵撕痛</text><text for="L38">终究尝到了初次失恋的心碎滋味</text><text for="L39">那是第一回如此用心地去爱</text><text for="L40">甚至觉得被你玩弄也心甘情愿</text><text for="L41">其实心底一直固执地相信</text><text for="L42">你是真的在爱着我的</text><text for="L43">你在哪呢</text><text for="L44">再抱抱我吧</text><text for="L45">好难熬的孤寂</text><text for="L46">哪怕世人都笑我不谙世事</text><text for="L47">我依然无法心生怨恨 这场最初的失恋心碎</text><text for="L48">我此生仅此一次的深刻心碎</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="First Heart Break"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="MIREI"/><amll:meta key="album" value="願い E.P."/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1538281340"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPU901701957"/></metadata></head><body><div begin="0:12.730" end="3:49.240"><p begin="0:12.730" end="0:17.270" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:12.730" end="0:12.950">赤</span><span begin="0:12.950" end="0:13.720">と青</span><span begin="0:13.720" end="0:13.910">の</span><span begin="0:13.910" end="0:14.420">カッ</span><span begin="0:14.420" end="0:14.790">プ</span><span begin="0:15.070" end="0:15.380">貸し</span><span begin="0:15.380" end="0:15.870">てく</span><span begin="0:15.870" end="0:16.320">れた</span><span begin="0:16.320" end="0:16.760">T</span><span begin="0:16.760" end="0:17.140">シャ</span><span begin="0:17.140" end="0:17.270">ツ</span></p><p begin="0:17.490" end="0:21.750" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:17.490" end="0:18.240">2人</span><span begin="0:18.240" end="0:18.470">の</span><span begin="0:18.470" end="0:19.190">部屋</span><span begin="0:19.190" end="0:19.490">に</span><span begin="0:19.490" end="0:20.350">1人</span><span begin="0:20.350" end="0:21.390">き</span><span begin="0:21.390" end="0:21.750">り</span></p><p begin="0:22.230" end="0:26.780" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:22.230" end="0:22.410">気</span><span begin="0:22.410" end="0:22.670">に</span><span begin="0:22.670" end="0:22.860">入っ</span><span begin="0:22.860" end="0:22.970">て</span><span begin="0:22.970" end="0:23.320">つ</span><span begin="0:23.320" end="0:23.530">け</span><span begin="0:23.530" end="0:23.99